            "review_title": "Review at River Bar Can Tho",
            "review_text": "Peter H\nBellingen, Australia6 contributions\n0\nGreat experience\nAug 2026 • Family\nThis is a must try! From the first moment you enter this beautiful building, you will find friendly staff with a smile eager to help a beautiful air-conditioned dinning room or amazing rooftop dining overlooking the river and festivals. The menu has something for everyone, beautiful eye fillet cooked medium rare to perfection, crispy skin salmon that is actually crispy skin without to much salt, or a delicious tasting board that goes well with some well deserved coronas. I highly recommend this amazing restaurant not just for the food but also the friendly staff that make you feel like family.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten August 30, 2026",
