            "review_title": "Review at River Bar Can Tho",
            "review_text": "andrew t\n1 contribution\n0\nCan Tho - Ninh Kieu Walking Street- Finest Bar!\nMay 2026 • Family\nRiver Bar opened less than a month ago. My father and I decided to check this place out today while we were walking Ninh Kieu Street. We first stopped in for some elegant mocktails. We were fortunate to speak and meet with the owner and he was a wonderful man. We ordered food and the steak was amazing! I bought Cold Cuts Platter and it was phenomenal. We will defintely return. To ALL THE TOURIST coming into the city of Can Tho...STOP BY and check their place out. Music and atmosphere is great.\nRead more\nInsider tip:\nThe Cold Cuts Platter. The Banh Quesadilla. Try it out. And drink wose check their Negroni (Gin-Campari-Sweet Vermouth)\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten May 20, 2026\nRIVER BAR CẦN THƠ\nDear Mr Andrew\nThank you so much for your 5-star review! We truly appreciate your support and are delighted you had a great experience at River Bar Can Tho.\n\nWe look forward to welcoming you back soon for more great cocktails, music, and unforgettable moments. \nThank you for your 5-star review! We’re delighted you enjoyed your experience with us. Your support means a lot, and we hope to welcome you back again soon!\nRead more\nWritten May 29, 2026\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
